{"version":"1.5.0","notes":"## 1.5.0 - 2026-10-26\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Linux .deb, .rpm, and AppImage downloads now require glibc 2.39 or newer, and the installer selects Snap on Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 and Debian 11/12 (#2094)\n\n### Features\n\n- See individual file receive results in history details and retry failed files without downloading successfully saved files again (#2108)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Show image previews for individual image files in the native Quick Panel (#2105)\n- Keep the native Quick Panel unlocked when closing the main window or entering lightweight mode, and dismiss it when switching to another window on Windows (#2103)\n- Unlock directly in the Quick Panel without opening the main window, and correctly shrink the panel window and text below 100% on Linux (#2102)\n- Make Windows Quick Panel fonts consistent with the main window, including Chinese text (#2098)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.5.0 - 2026-10-26\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Linux 的 .deb、.rpm 和 AppImage 安装包现在要求 glibc 2.39 或更新版本，安装脚本在 Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 和 Debian 11/12 上改用 Snap (#2094)\n\n### Features\n\n- 在历史详情中查看各个文件的接收结果，并仅重试失败的文件，无需重新下载已保存的文件 (#2108)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复原生快捷面板无法预览单个图片文件的问题 (#2105)\n- 关闭主窗口或进入轻量模式后，原生快捷面板保持解锁，并在 Windows 上切换到其他窗口时自动收起 (#2103)\n- 支持直接在快捷面板内解锁，无需打开主窗口，并修复 Linux 上面板窗口和文字无法缩小到 100% 以下的问题 (#2102)\n- 统一 Windows 快捷面板与主窗口的字体显示，包括中文字体 (#2098)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-10-26T02:11:16Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0/UniClipboard_1.5.0_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0/UniClipboard_1.5.0_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0/UniClipboard_1.5.0_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0/UniClipboard_1.5.0_x64-setup.exe"},"darw